      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It might have to do with your \"Mic defaults on\" setting. If I remember correctly this setting is re-applied whenever you join a new world, and whenever your VRC Window gains focus. For example if you use virtual desktop and click across windows. You might not have to even click on the VRC window yourself as some virtual desktop apps will give focus to windows just because you move the mouse over them with your controller.\nI would recommend that you untick \"Mic default on\" and see how it goes. If it's neither of those then it might be a bug.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
